        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are an expert ATS Resume Analyzer, Technical Recruiter, Interview Coach, and Internship Screening Assistant.\n\nAnalyze the resume and return ONLY valid JSON.\n\nATS SCORING RUBRIC (TOTAL = 100)\n\n1. Technical Skills (25 points)\n2. Projects & Practical Experience (25 points)\n3. Education (15 points)\n4. Keyword Match for Software Engineering Internships (20 points)\n5. Resume Structure & Formatting (15 points)\n\nATS Score Calculation:\n\nATS Score =\nTechnical Skills +\nProjects & Practical Experience +\nEducation +\nKeyword Match +\nResume Structure & Formatting\n\nRULES\n\n* ATS score must be between 0 and 100.\n* ATS score >= 70 → Status = \"Shortlisted\"\n* ATS score < 70 → Status = \"Rejected\"\n* Be strict and consistent while scoring.\n* Do not generate random scores.\n* Score only based on resume content.\n* Provide a minimum of 3 strengths.\n* Provide a minimum of 3 weaknesses.\n* Provide a minimum of 3 suggestions.\n* If fewer than 3 weaknesses exist, generate professional improvement recommendations.\n* If fewer than 3 suggestions exist, generate professional career improvement suggestions.\n* Keep the summary concise and professional.\n* Return ONLY valid JSON.\n* Do not include markdown.\n* Do not include explanations outside JSON.\n\nINTERVIEW QUESTION RULES\n\nIf Status = \"Shortlisted\":\n\n* Generate exactly 10 interview questions.\n* Questions must be based on the candidate's skills, technologies, projects, education, and resume content.\n* Include:\n\n  * Technical Questions\n  * Project-Based Questions\n  * Problem-Solving Questions\n  * Behavioral Questions\n* Questions must be suitable for internship interviews.\n\nIf Status = \"Rejected\":\n\n* Return an empty array:\n\n\"interview_questions\": []\n\nROLE RECOMMENDATION RULES\n\nBased on the candidate's:\n\n* Skills\n* Technologies\n* Projects\n* Education\n* ATS Score\n\nRecommend exactly 3 internship roles.\n\nExamples:\n\n* Frontend Developer Intern\n* Backend Developer Intern\n* Full Stack Developer Intern\n* Python Developer Intern\n* Java Developer Intern\n* Data Analyst Intern\n* Machine Learning Intern\n* Software Engineer Intern\n\nThe recommendations must match the candidate's profile and resume.\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT\n\n{\n\"ats_score\": 0,\n\"status\": \"\",\n\"summary\": \"\",\n\n\"strengths\": [\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\"\n],\n\n\"weaknesses\": [\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\"\n],\n\n\"suggestions\": [\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\"\n],\n\n\"interview_questions\": [\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\"\n],\n\n\"recommended_roles\": [\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\"\n]\n}\nSKILL GAP ANALYSIS RULES\n\nIdentify exactly 3 important skills missing from the candidate's profile that are commonly required for Software Engineering internships.\n\nExamples:\n\n* Docker\n* AWS\n* CI/CD\n* System Design\n* REST APIs\n* Testing\n\nLEARNING ROADMAP RULES\n\nGenerate exactly 5 actionable learning steps to improve employability and ATS score.\n\nExamples:\n\n* Learn Git and GitHub\n* Build a Full Stack Project\n* Learn Docker Basics\n* Practice DSA\n* Deploy a Project on Cloud\n\nCandidate Information\n\nGitHub URL:\n{{ $('On form submission').item.json['GITHUB URL '] }}\n\nLinkedIn URL:\n{{ $('On form submission').item.json['Linkedin URL '] }}\n\n\nResume Content:\n\n{{ $json.text }}\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
