tem.json.output.ats_score >= 70\n? '✅ Recommended for Interview'\n: '⚠️ Resume Needs Improvement'\n}}\n</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>\n<b>Best Regards \n\nCODEGRES</b><br>\nAutomated Internship Recruitment Assistant\n</p>\n",
